<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86249" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρᾱΰνω</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρηΰνω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ</span>], fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠνῶ</span>: aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπράῡνα</span>:—
			Med.
		, 
			Ep.
		
		aor.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρηϋνατο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					29.276
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, fut.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πραϋνθήσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.135
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.478
			</span></i>: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπραΰνθην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					440d
				</span></i>
			: pf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεπράϋσμαι</span> (v. infr.): (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πραΰς</span>):— <i>make soft,
			mild,</i> or <i>gentle, soothe, calm,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πνοιὰς . . πρηΰνει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Th.</u>
					254
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Merc.</u>
					417
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἕλκος</span>
			<i>soothe</i> a raging sore, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				650
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τινὰ λόγοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					837
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τινὰς πρὸς ἀλλήλους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					4.47
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ὑπερήφανα ἔργα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sol.
					4.38
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀργήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					822
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν θυμόν, τὸ θυμοειδές,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				731d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>R.</u>
				572a
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				9.5
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>become milder, abate,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρηϋνομένου τοῦ χειμῶνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.25
				</span></i>
			; of persons, <i>grow milder, be appeased,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				121
			</span></i>. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ᾽,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				440d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1380a5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>tame</i> wild animals, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐρῆας, κύνα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				797
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				2.3.9
			</span></i>; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλέφαντα] π. καὶ ἡμερῶσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					10.10
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεπραϋσμένος πέρδιξ</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				4.16
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγείρεσθαι,</span> of
			horses, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				9.10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θῆρες ἀνὰ δρυμὰ πρηΰνονται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Euph.
					177
				</span></i>
			 ( =
			<i><span class="en">
				Call.
			</span></i><i>Fr.anon.</i><i><span class="en">
				74
			</span></i>).</div>
